gc_fence: build test
gc diag: reset-attempt n=1 004=0x7ffffffe 000=0x00000109
gc diag: reset-attempt n=2 004=0x7fffffff 000=0x00000109
gc diag: after-reset 3a8=0x00000000 10c=0x00000001
gc diag: after-init 3a8=0x00000000 10c=0x00000001
